{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of an agile space fighter and protect a vulnerable planet from endless waves of enemies. In <i>Celestial Wardens</i>, strategy meets action: pilot your ship in real-time while constructing planetary defenses in a unique blend of top-down shooting and tower defense mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Massive enemy waves with different threats.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Build planetary turrets to defend your planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Upgrade your ship with new weapons, modules, and special techs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Passive resource income from the planet \u2014 enhance the economy or defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Research new technologies to gain access to new buildings and ship modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, adapt, and stand as the last line of defense. Will your ship be enough?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855550?t=1756079364","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855550?t=1756079364","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855550/2783038d4838d99f062425fb874fe4c6d845b3ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756079364","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855550/2783038d4838d99f062425fb874fe4c6d845b3ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756079364","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of an agile space fighter and protect a vulnerable planet from endless waves of enemies. In <i>Celestial Wardens</i>, strategy meets action: pilot your ship in real-time while constructing planetary defenses in a unique blend of top-down shooting and tower defense mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Massive enemy waves with different threats.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Build planetary turrets to defend your planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Upgrade your ship with new weapons, modules, and special techs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Passive resource income from the planet \u2014 enhance the economy or defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Research new technologies to gain access to new buildings and ship modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, adapt, and stand as the last line of defense. Will your ship be enough?</p>","developers":["Crimson Mantis Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855550/f896a3c303e16329a448372c3cb704d6dd361a15/header.jpg?t=1756079364","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257165614,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257165614/movie480.mp4?t=1752229092","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257165614/movie_max.mp4?t=1752229092"},"name":"Gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257165614/b1fc40583fa8b24908d1c79100cc0817accf900f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752229092","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257165614/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752229092","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257165614/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752229092"}}],"name":"Celestial\u202fWardens","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":f